{
  "label": "Agent 2 - Nurture",
  "description": "Every morning: finds leads that did not convert yet and are due for a follow-up, writes the next touch (follow-up, case study, post, check-in) and schedules the one after it. Stops after 5 touches.",
  "inputs": [],
  "triggers": [
    {
      "name": "schedule_1",
      "type": "schedule/v1/cron",
      "parameters": {
        "timezone": "Europe/Zagreb",
        "expression": "30 8 * * 1-5"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "name": "googleSheets_1",
      "type": "googleSheets/v1/getRows",
      "parameters": {
        "spreadsheetId": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID",
        "sheetName": "Leads",
        "isTheFirstRowHeader": true
      },
      "connections": {
        "googleSheets": {
          "componentName": "googleSheets",
          "componentVersion": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "loop_1",
      "type": "loop/v1",
      "parameters": {
        "items": "${googleSheets_1}",
        "iteratee": [
          {
            "name": "condition_1",
            "type": "condition/v1",
            "parameters": {
              "rawExpression": true,
              "expression": "=(${loop_1.item.status} == 'contacted' or ${loop_1.item.status} == 'nurturing') and ${loop_1.item.email} != '' and ${loop_1.item.nextTouch} <= format(now(), 'yyyy-MM-dd')",
              "caseTrue": [
                {
                  "name": "aiAgent_1",
                  "type": "aiAgent/v1/chat",
                  "parameters": {
                    "format": "SIMPLE",
                    "systemPrompt": "You are my relationship nurture agent. A lead got my first message and has not replied, or told me to come back later.\nYou write the NEXT email in the sequence. You never sound like an automated sequence.\n\nOFFER (edit this block):\n- LinkedIn Masterclass delivered in-house for company teams\n- Moderating and hosting conferences, panels and fireside chats\n- Keynote talks at conferences\n- Marketing campaigns run on my personal LinkedIn profile\n\nCONTENT LIBRARY (edit this block, the agent only uses links from here):\n- Case study: https://REPLACE/case-study-1\n- Newsletter archive: https://REPLACE/newsletter\n- Recent LinkedIn post: https://REPLACE/post\n\nSequence (touchCount is how many messages the lead already got):\n- touchCount 1: short follow-up on the first message, new angle, same ask.\n- touchCount 2: send the most relevant case study with one sentence on why it fits them.\n- touchCount 3: share a recent post or newsletter issue, no ask, just value.\n- touchCount 4: personal check-in (\"still relevant for Q1?\").\n- touchCount 5 or more: return action \"stop\".\nIf notes say they asked to be contacted at a specific time, reference that (\"you asked me to get back to you in September\").\nWrite in the lead's language, max 80 words, no em dashes. Reply in the same thread style: subject starts with \"Re: \" plus the original topic.\nnextTouchInDays: 4 after touch 1, 6 after touch 2, 10 after touch 3, 14 after touch 4.",
                    "userPrompt": "Lead: ${loop_1.item}",
                    "maxToolCalls": 15,
                    "response": {
                      "responseFormat": "JSON",
                      "responseSchema": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"send\", \"stop\"]}, \"subject\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"message\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"touchCount\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"touchCount after this message is sent\"}, \"nextTouchInDays\": {\"type\": \"integer\"}}, \"required\": [\"action\", \"subject\", \"message\", \"touchCount\", \"nextTouchInDays\"]}"
                    }
                  },
                  "clusterElements": {
                    "model": {
                      "name": "openAi_1",
                      "type": "openAi/v1/model",
                      "parameters": {
                        "model": "gpt-5-mini"
                      },
                      "connections": {
                        "openAi_1": {
                          "componentName": "openAi",
                          "componentVersion": 1
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "name": "condition_2",
                  "type": "condition/v1",
                  "parameters": {
                    "rawExpression": false,
                    "conditions": [
                      [
                        {
                          "type": "string",
                          "value1": "${aiAgent_1.action}",
                          "operation": "EQUALS",
                          "value2": "send"
                        }
                      ]
                    ],
                    "caseTrue": [
                      {
                        "name": "googleMail_1",
                        "type": "googleMail/v1/sendEmail",
                        "parameters": {
                          "to": [
                            "${loop_1.item.email}"
                          ],
                          "subject": "${aiAgent_1.subject}",
                          "bodyType": "plain",
                          "body": "${aiAgent_1.message}"
                        },
                        "connections": {
                          "googleMail": {
                            "componentName": "googleMail",
                            "componentVersion": 1
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "name": "googleSheets_2",
                        "type": "googleSheets/v1/updateRow",
                        "parameters": {
                          "spreadsheetId": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID",
                          "sheetName": "Leads",
                          "rowNumber": "=${loop_1.index} + 2",
                          "isTheFirstRowHeader": true,
                          "updateWholeRow": false,
                          "row": {
                            "values": [
                              {
                                "column": "status",
                                "value": "nurturing"
                              },
                              {
                                "column": "touchCount",
                                "value": "${aiAgent_1.touchCount}"
                              },
                              {
                                "column": "nextTouch",
                                "value": "=format(plusDays(now(), ${aiAgent_1.nextTouchInDays}), 'yyyy-MM-dd')"
                              },
                              {
                                "column": "lastMessage",
                                "value": "${aiAgent_1.message}"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "connections": {
                          "googleSheets": {
                            "componentName": "googleSheets",
                            "componentVersion": 1
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "caseFalse": [
                      {
                        "name": "googleSheets_3",
                        "type": "googleSheets/v1/updateRow",
                        "parameters": {
                          "spreadsheetId": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID",
                          "sheetName": "Leads",
                          "rowNumber": "=${loop_1.index} + 2",
                          "isTheFirstRowHeader": true,
                          "updateWholeRow": false,
                          "row": {
                            "values": [
                              {
                                "column": "status",
                                "value": "cold"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "connections": {
                          "googleSheets": {
                            "componentName": "googleSheets",
                            "componentVersion": 1
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "caseFalse": []
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
